     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\">Hi all, <div>re-posting as a new topic. </div><div><br></div><div>PS.</div><div>The suggestion on dummyfying ordered categorical has already been brought to my attention by <span style=\"font-size:small\">Terrence D. Jorgensen, whom I thank.</span></div><div><br></div><div><span style=\"font-size:small\">hi, I am having a similar problem with ordinal data. lavaan version: 0.6-5</span></div><div><font size=\"2\"><br></font><div style=\"font-size:small\">this is the error message i get:</div><div style=\"font-size:small\"><br></div><div style=\"font-size:small\"><div style=\"background-color:rgb(250,250,250);border-color:rgb(187,187,187);border-style:solid;border-width:1px\"><code><div style=\"background-color:rgb(250,250,250);border-color:rgb(187,187,187);border-style:solid;border-width:1px\"><code><div><span style=\"color:#660\">&gt;</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> cc_fit_r </span><span style=\"color:#660\">&lt;-</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> lavaan</span><span style=\"color:#660\">::</span><span style=\"color:#000\">cfa</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">cc_model_r</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> data </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> cc</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> ordered </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> c</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;gend&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;disab&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;orph&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;sol&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;edu&q