tyle=\"color:#660\">.</span><span style=\"color:#000\">VD </span><span style=\"color:#660\">:</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>  longer </span><span style=\"color:#008\">object</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> length </span><span style=\"color:#008\">is</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#008\">not</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> a multiple of shorter </span><span style=\"color:#008\">object</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> length<br></span><span style=\"color:#066\">4</span><span style=\"color:#660\">:</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#606\">In</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> th</span><span style=\"color:#660\">[</span><span style=\"color:#000\">th</span><span style=\"color:#660\">.</span><span style=\"color:#000\">idx </span><span style=\"color:#660\">&gt;</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#066\">0L</span><span style=\"color:#660\">]</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">&lt;-</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> TAU</span><span style=\"color:#660\">[,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#066\">1L</span><span style=\"color:#660\">]</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">:</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>  number of items to replace </span><span style=\"color:#008\">is</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#008\">not</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> a multiple of replacement length</span></div></code></div><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"><br></span></code></div><div><br></div><div>And this is my model:</div><div><br></div><div><br></div></div><div style=\"font-size:small\"><div style=\"background-color:rgb(250,250,250);border-color:rgb(187,187,187);border-style:solid;border-width:1px\"><code><div style=\"background-color:rgb(250,250,250);border-color:rgb(187,187,187);border-style:solid;border-width:1px\"><code><div><span style=\"color:#000\">cc_model_r </span><span style=\"color:#660\">&lt;-</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#080\">&#39;<br>cc =~ a*edu + b*sol # 2 reflective items to identify the formative construct<br>cc &lt;~ c*age + d*gend + e*disab + f*orph # formative construct<br>&#39;</span></div></code></div><span style=\"color:rgb(0,136,0)\"><br></span></code></div><div><br></div><div>Data can be retrieved <a href=\"https://drive.google.com/open?id=1FjIKHiozCM8DWlwCCrrFnzNigJYpfOtY\" style=\"color:rgb(17,85,204)\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://drive.google.com/open?id%3D1FjIKHiozCM8DWlwCCrrFnzNigJYpfOtY&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792422742897000&amp;usg=AOvVaw2cvK6mP0Z6uvyG3hF0HQZU\">here</a>.</div></div><div style=\"font-size:small\"><br></div><div style=\"font-size:small\">I suspected the issue might be related to NAs. A crosstab revealed that there are 12 NAS between edu and sol and 85 NAs between sol and gend. I tried re-fitting the model using the argument missing = &quot;pairwise&quot;, but unsuccessfully.</div><div style=\"font-size:small\"><br></div><div style=\"font-size:small\">Regards</div><div style=\"font-size:small\"><br></div><div style=\"font-size:small\">Manolo</div></div></div>"
